Description: Crash-safe custom GIF animations for the BackBoard respring screen on rootless iOS 15 and 16. Version 3.3.0 adds an animated theme gallery with twelve original redistributable packs, live previews, one-tap safe staging, automatic Springy and SnowBoard theme discovery, GIF/frame-folder import, DEB and ZIP extraction, and a compatibility catalog for legacy free packs without illegally rebundling unlicensed artwork.
